Source: lingmo-dm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>
Build-Depends: cmake (>= 3.22),
               debhelper-compat (= 14),
               lingmo-toolkit,
               libpam0g-dev,
               libsystemd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/lingmoos/lingmo-dm

Package: lingmo-dm
Architecture: any
Depends: adduser,
         lingmo-compositor,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Lingmo OS display manager
 Runs the Lingmo login screen and the Wayland session a user logs in to,
 Lingmo or any other desktop in wayland-sessions, and hands the display
 between them without a black frame or the console in between.
